  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 1202.13 Service",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 1202.13 “Service” means to inspect, test or repair fire extinguishing equipment, fire sprinkler equipment or fire alarm equipment in order to furnish or return the fire extinguishing system, fire sprinkler system or fire alarm system to operational condition, and can include maintenance contracts.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Saf-C 1200) #9810-A, eff 11-6-10",
